Description: Interactive data tables for R, based on the 'React Table'
    JavaScript library. Provides an HTML widget that can be used in 'R Markdown'
    or 'Quarto' documents, 'Shiny' applications, or viewed from an R console.
    An independent fork of the 'reactable' package by Greg Lin, adding native
    'Shiny' cell inputs with server validation, configurable disabled states,
    row addition and removal, and rich tooltips. Not an official release of
    the original 'reactable' project.
